<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The enterprise-wide staff number issued by the HR system and used as the internal primary key by older enterprise systems. Exactly 7 characters: U or N followed by 6 digits, case-insensitive and normalised to uppercase. Unique per member of staff, never reissued and never changed. The identity provider is its source of truth; applications read it from a token claim and do not edit it." <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StaffId" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://ontology-kit.dev/schema#ValueObject> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#_meta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#_meta> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.1.0" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> <https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#StaffId> <urn:division-ontology:links> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AcceptProposal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AcceptProposal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Creates or updates the calling Manager's own `ProposalAcceptance`; on the 3rd acceptance, atomically creates the `ConfirmedSlot` and its `SlotCapacity` rows." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AcceptProposal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AcceptProposal" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AcceptProposal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#UseCase> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AcceptProposal> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[slot-negotiation](../.kiro/specs/slot-negotiation/design.md), [Plan 19](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/19-proposal-acceptance-headcount-revision.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ActorType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ActorType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Who caused an audited change: an Entra ID staff identity, a candidate acting through a tokenised link, or a background job." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ActorType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ActorType" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ActorType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ActorType> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area K](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/k-audit-trail.md), [Plan 11](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/11-infrastructure-email-token-audit.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ActorType> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`Staff`, `CandidateToken`, `System`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AdjustConfirmedSlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AdjustConfirmedSlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lets a Manager replace `totalHeadcount` on the `SlotCapacity` for their current `AppointmentType`, changing `remainingCapacity` by the same delta while holding the same row lock used by `AdjustSlotCapacity`." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AdjustConfirmedSlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AdjustConfirmedSlotCapacity" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AdjustConfirmedSlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#UseCase> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AdjustConfirmedSlotCapacity> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[capacity-concurrency-rules](../.kiro/specs/capacity-concurrency-rules/design.md), [Plan 20](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/20-confirmed-slot-capacity-adjustment.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AdjustSlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AdjustSlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The row-locked read-check-write path for booking-driven changes to `SlotCapacity.remainingCapacity`." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AdjustSlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AdjustSlotCapacity" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AdjustSlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#UseCase> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AdjustSlotCapacity> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[capacity-concurrency-rules](../.kiro/specs/capacity-concurrency-rules/design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AppointmentType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AppointmentType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One of the 3 fixed appointment types (Drug & Alcohol Testing, Medical Check-up, Uniform Fitting). `code` is the short form (`DAT`, `MED`, `UNI`) used as the `ConfirmedSlot` CSV import column headers; a `Candidate`'s required `AppointmentType`s are derived from `EmployeeGroupRequirement` via the `Candidate`'s `EmployeeGroup` and are no longer selected directly by candidate CSV upload. Under the scoped multi-role design, its current Manager is derived from the unique Manager `StaffAccessProfile` rather than duplicated on this entity." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AppointmentType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AppointmentType" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AppointmentType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AppointmentType> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area A](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/a-appointment-types-admin-settings.md), [Plan 02](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/02-domain-appointment-types.md), [Issue #71 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization-design.md), [Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AppointmentType> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`id`, `code`, `name`; legacy `managerUserId` is removed by Issue #71" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditAction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The complete set of state changes recorded in `AuditLog`, including candidate Employee Group assignments, recovery lifecycle actions, access-profile actions, and appointment-delivery actions. `StaffRolesSynced` records an identity-provider-driven role change with `ActorType.System`, distinct from the Admin-driven `StaffAccessChanged`/`StaffAccessRemoved` scope actions. Candidate and appointment details contain identifiers, canonical codes, and old/new statuses only, never names, email addresses, clinical data, or arbitrary free text." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AuditAction" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditAction> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area K](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/k-audit-trail.md), [Plan 11](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/11-infrastructure-email-token-audit.md), [Plan 20](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/20-confirmed-slot-capacity-adjustment.md), [Plan 23](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/23-confirmed-slot-bulk-import.md), [Issue #71 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization-design.md), [Issue #26 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-booking-appointment-workspace-design.md), [Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md), [IdP-sourced roles design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-10-idp-sourced-staff-roles-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditAction> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`ProposalCreated`, `ProposalWithdrawn`, `AcceptanceRecorded`, `AcceptanceWithdrawn`, `SlotConfirmed`, `SlotCancelled`, `CapacityDecremented`, `CapacityIncremented`, `InviteCreated`, `InviteSent`, `InviteExpired`, `InviteOptionReplaced`, `BookingCreated`, `BookingCancelled`, `CapacityAdjusted`, `SlotImported`, `StaffAccessChanged`, `StaffAccessRemoved`, `StaffRolesSynced`, `AppointmentCheckedIn`, `AppointmentCompleted`, `AppointmentMarkedNoShow`, `AppointmentStatusCorrected`, `EmployeeGroupAssigned`, `EmployeeGroupChanged`, `RecoveryInviteCreated`, `RecoveryInviteCancelled`, `RecoveryBookingCreated`, `RecoveryBookingConcluded`, `CandidateDeleted`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditLog> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditLog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An append-only record of a state change to `SlotProposal`, `ConfirmedSlot`, `Candidate`, `Invite`, `Booking`, `StaffAccessProfile`, or `BookingAppointment`. Candidate group changes and recovery actions store fixed identifiers, canonical codes, and statuses only. A candidate-scoped history covers the entries recorded against the `Candidate` record itself and against their `Invite`, `Booking`, and `BookingAppointment` records." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditLog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AuditLog" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditLog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditLog> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area K](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/k-audit-trail.md), [Plan 11](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/11-infrastructure-email-token-audit.md), [Issue #71 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization-design.md), [Issue #26 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-booking-appointment-workspace-design.md), [Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#AuditLog> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`id`, `entityType`, `entityId`, `action`, `actorType`, `actorId`, `timestamp`, `details`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointmentStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointmentStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Independent operational progress for one `BookingAppointment`. Normal progress is `Expected` → `CheckedIn` → `Completed`, with `Expected` → `NoShow` as the alternative outcome and bounded one-step corrections back toward `Expected`." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointmentStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BookingAppointmentStatus" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointmentStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointmentStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Issue #26 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-booking-appointment-workspace-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointmentStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`Expected`, `CheckedIn`, `Completed`, `NoShow`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The operational instance of one required `AppointmentType` within one `Booking`. It progresses independently through check-in and outcome states, records the latest staff changer, and is unique per (`Booking`, `AppointmentType`) pair." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BookingAppointment" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointment> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Issue #26 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-booking-appointment-workspace-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingAppointment> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`id`, `bookingId`, `appointmentTypeId`, `status`, `checkedInAt`, `outcomeAt`, `lastChangedByStaffUserId`, `lastChangedAt`, `version`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An `Active` original Booking is the Candidate's appointment journey root. An active recovery Booking holds its own `SlotCapacity`; it becomes `Concluded` once every one of its Booking Appointments has reached `Completed` or `NoShow`, preserving history while allowing another recovery after a no-show." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BookingStatus" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area F](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/f-cancellation-reschedule.md), [Plan 04](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/04-domain-candidates-invites.md), [Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#BookingStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`Active`, `Cancelled`, `Concluded`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Booking> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Booking> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Created when a `Candidate` confirms one `InviteOption`. `inviteId` records which `Invite` it came from. `recoveryOfBookingId` is null for the original shared-slot Booking and identifies that original Booking for a later missed-appointment recovery. A recovery Booking may become `Concluded`; cancellation sets `status` rather than deleting the row so history survives." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Booking> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Booking" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Booking> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Booking> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area E](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/e-candidate-booking-flow.md), [Plan 04](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/04-domain-candidates-invites.md), [Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Booking> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`id`, `candidateId`, `confirmedSlotId`, `inviteId`, `recoveryOfBookingId` (nullable), `createdAt`, `status`, `manageTokenHash`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadinessCode> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadinessCode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Stable internal reason describing the Candidate's appointment readiness. Only `Ready` means every current derived requirement has a Completed Booking Appointment in the non-cancelled booking journey." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadinessCode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CandidateReadinessCode" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadinessCode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadinessCode> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadinessCode> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`Ready`, `EmployeeGroupUnassigned`, `NoActiveBooking`, `RequirementSnapshotMismatch`, `AppointmentsOutstanding`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadiness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadiness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A calculated, non-persisted view of whether the current derived requirements are satisfied across the active original Booking and its non-cancelled recovery Bookings. It contains only a stable reason code plus outstanding Appointment Type codes and names." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadiness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CandidateReadiness" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadiness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#ValueObject> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadiness> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateReadiness> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`candidateId`, `code`, `outstandingAppointmentTypes`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One materialized `AppointmentType` a given `Candidate` currently requires, derived only from that Candidate's active `EmployeeGroup`. Legacy rows remain unchanged until explicit reconciliation." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CandidateRequirement" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateRequirement> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area C](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/c-candidate-management.md), [Plan 04](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/04-domain-candidates-invites.md), [Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateRequirement> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`candidateId`, `appointmentTypeId`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Where a `Candidate` sits in the invite/booking lifecycle. Surfaced verbatim (with friendlier wording) on the coordinator dashboards." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CandidateStatus" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
