<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area C](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/c-candidate-management.md), [Plan 04](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/04-domain-candidates-invites.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#CandidateStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`NotYetInvited`, `AwaitingAvailability`, `Invited`, `Booked`, `NoResponseNeedsFollowUp`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Candidate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Candidate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person invited to attend appointments, entered via CSV upload or CRUD API. `employeeGroupId` is nullable only during the staged legacy reconciliation window and required for every new Candidate. `statusChangedAt` is stamped by the persistence layer whenever `status` is written, and is what the coordinator dashboards mean by \"waiting since\"." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Candidate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Candidate" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Candidate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Candidate> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area C](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/c-candidate-management.md), [Plan 04](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/04-domain-candidates-invites.md), [Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Candidate> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`id`, `name`, `email`, `employeeGroupId`, `status`, `statusChangedAt`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlotStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlotStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "`Active` slots are the only ones an `Invite` may offer." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlotStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ConfirmedSlotStatus" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlotStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlotStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area F](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/f-cancellation-reschedule.md), [Plan 03](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/03-domain-slot-negotiation.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlotStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`Active`, `Cancelled`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlot> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A `SlotProposal` accepted by all 3 managers, or a slot an Admin or Coordinator bulk-imported directly; bookable by candidates either way. `proposalId` is null for an imported slot — that nullability is its provenance marker, no separate field needed. `date` and `startTime` are carried as one `SlotWindow`." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ConfirmedSlot" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlot> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area B](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/b-slot-negotiation.md), [Plan 03](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/03-domain-slot-negotiation.md), [Plan 23](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/23-confirmed-slot-bulk-import.md), [Issue #71 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ConfirmedSlot> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`id`, `proposalId` (nullable), `date`, `startTime`, `status`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailLog> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailLog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A durable record of one candidate email delivery attempt. Identity, template, and safe context identifiers are immutable; claim and outcome fields transition from `Pending` to `Sent`, `Failed`, or `Resolved`. The nullable context identifiers regenerate a message without storing raw tokens, URLs, or bodies." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailLog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EmailLog" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailLog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailLog> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area H](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/h-notifications-email-templates.md), [Plan 11](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/11-infrastructure-email-token-audit.md), Repair D" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailLog> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`id`, `candidateId`, `templateName`, `sentAt`, `status`, `inviteId` (nullable), `bookingId` (nullable), `confirmedSlotId` (nullable), `claimedAt` (nullable)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Outcome of one `EmailLog` delivery attempt. `Pending` means the business transaction committed and dispatch has not yet reached a terminal provider outcome; `Failed` remains the failed-email count; `Resolved` means a later durable retry superseded an outstanding attempt." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EmailStatus" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area H](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/h-notifications-email-templates.md), [Plan 11](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/11-infrastructure-email-token-audit.md), Repair D" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`Sent`, `Failed`, `Pending`, `Resolved`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailTemplate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailTemplate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The 4 candidate-facing emails." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailTemplate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EmailTemplate" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailTemplate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailTemplate> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area H](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/h-notifications-email-templates.md), [Plan 11](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/11-infrastructure-email-token-audit.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmailTemplate> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`CandidateInvite`, `BookingConfirmation`, `SlotCancelledRebookingNeeded`, `CandidateReinvite`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroupRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroupRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One fixed `AppointmentType` required by an `EmployeeGroup`. The complete mapping is seeded once as reviewed reference data rather than duplicated in handlers or clients." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroupRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EmployeeGroupRequirement" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroupRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroupRequirement> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroupRequirement> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`employeeGroupId`, `appointmentTypeId`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroup> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Change-controlled reference data describing one employment category. Its immutable canonical `code` identifies it at import and MCP boundaries; its mappings determine the current `CandidateRequirement` set. The first release contains Cabin Crew (`CABIN_CREW`), Pilots (`PILOTS`), Ground Operations Agent (`GROUND_OPERATIONS_AGENT`), Engineering (`ENGINEERING`), and Ground Transport Services (`GROUND_TRANSPORT_SERVICES`) only." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EmployeeGroup" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroup> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#EmployeeGroup> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`id`, `code`, `name`, `isActive`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ImportConfirmedSlots> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ImportConfirmedSlots> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Validates a CSV of already-agreed slots for an Admin or Coordinator and, all-or-nothing, creates each row's `ConfirmedSlot` and its 3 `SlotCapacity` rows directly — bypassing `ProposeSlot`/`AcceptProposal` entirely." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ImportConfirmedSlots> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ImportConfirmedSlots" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
