<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ImportConfirmedSlots> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area B](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/b-slot-negotiation.md#increment-bulk-import-already-agreed-confirmed-slots-issue-25), [Plan 23](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/23-confirmed-slot-bulk-import.md), [Issue #71 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteOption> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteOption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One of the 3 `ConfirmedSlot` options offered within an `Invite`." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteOption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "InviteOption" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
