<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteOption> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`inviteId`, `confirmedSlotId`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One `AppointmentType` snapshotted when an `Invite` is issued. An initial Invite snapshots all current derived `CandidateRequirement` rows; a recovery Invite snapshots only still-outstanding no-show types." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "InviteRequirement" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
