<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "`Used` once a `Booking` is made against it; `Expired` once the sweep passes its `expiresAt`; `Superseded` when a newer Invite or a changed Employee Group replaces it; `Cancelled` when a Coordinator explicitly ends a recovery Invite." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "InviteStatus" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area D](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/d-invite-engine.md), [Plan 04](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/04-domain-candidates-invites.md), [Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#InviteStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`Pending`, `Used`, `Expired`, `Superseded`, `Cancelled`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Invite> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Invite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An offer to a `Candidate` of 3 `ConfirmedSlot` options, carrying a single-use signed token and a snapshotted requirement set. `recoveryOfBookingId` is null for an initial booking invitation and identifies the active original `Booking` for missed-appointment recovery." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Invite> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Invite" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
