<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Invite> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area D](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/d-invite-engine.md), [Plan 04](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/04-domain-candidates-invites.md), [Issue #91 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-09-employee-group-requirements-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
