<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#OutstandingAppointmentType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#OutstandingAppointmentType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Minimum-data readiness detail for one current Candidate Requirement that has no Completed Booking Appointment in the non-cancelled booking journey. `isRecoverable` is true only when its latest non-cancelled attempt is No-show." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#OutstandingAppointmentType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OutstandingAppointmentType" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
