<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ProposalAcceptance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ProposalAcceptance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One manager's acceptance of a `SlotProposal`, carrying their own headcount. The same manager may revise `headcount` in place while the proposal remains `Open`; another manager may not read or change it." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
