<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ProposalAcceptance> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area B](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/b-slot-negotiation.md), [Plan 03](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/03-domain-slot-negotiation.md), [Plan 19](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/19-proposal-acceptance-headcount-revision.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ProposalAcceptance> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`proposalId`, `appointmentTypeId`, `managerUserId`, `headcount`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ProposeSlot> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ProposeSlot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Creates a `SlotProposal` with status Open." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ProposeSlot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ProposeSlot" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
