<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReassignAppointmentTypeManager> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReassignAppointmentTypeManager> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Atomically changes which `StaffAccessProfile` holds Manager for an `AppointmentType`, preserving the former profile's other roles." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReassignAppointmentTypeManager> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReassignAppointmentTypeManager" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReassignAppointmentTypeManager> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#UseCase> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReassignAppointmentTypeManager> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[appointment-types-admin-settings](../.kiro/specs/appointment-types-admin-settings/design.md), [Issue #71 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReplaceStaffAccessProfileScope> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReplaceStaffAccessProfileScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Atomically replaces an existing `StaffAccessProfile`'s `appointmentTypeId` scope and concurrency version, enforcing Manager uniqueness per `AppointmentType`. Cannot create a profile or change `roles`; targets only a `staffUserId` that already has a profile from its own role sync." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReplaceStaffAccessProfileScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReplaceStaffAccessProfileScope" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReplaceStaffAccessProfileScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#UseCase> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReplaceStaffAccessProfileScope> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[IdP-sourced roles design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-10-idp-sourced-staff-roles-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReplaceStaffAccessProfile> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReplaceStaffAccessProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Superseded by `ReplaceStaffAccessProfileScope`. Previously created or atomically replaced one identity's complete role set, shared appointment-type scope, and concurrency version while enforcing Admin exclusivity and Manager uniqueness; role assignment is no longer an Admin-driven operation. The name remains canonical only so the Issue #71 design and narrative continue to describe the implementation they recorded accurately." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReplaceStaffAccessProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ReplaceStaffAccessProfile" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReplaceStaffAccessProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#UseCase> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#ReplaceStaffAccessProfile> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Issue #71 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#RetryEmail> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#RetryEmail> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Locks the newest unresolved `EmailLog` for a `Candidate`, derives its `EmailTemplate` and safe context server-side, rotates any token hash, and stages a fresh attempt before post-commit dispatch." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#RetryEmail> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RetryEmail" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#RetryEmail> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#UseCase> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#RetryEmail> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "Repair D" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Role> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The identity-provider-assigned staff roles (Entra App Roles in production, Keycloak realm roles in local/dev), mirrored onto `StaffAccessProfile` rather than administered by JointBooking. Admin is exclusive; Coordinator is unscoped and may combine with Manager and/or AppointmentStaff; Manager and AppointmentStaff use the profile's single `AppointmentType` scope. `Candidate` is deliberately not a `Role` value — candidates are token-authenticated, not staff identities." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Role" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Role> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area I](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/i-roles-access-control.md), [Issue #71 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization-design.md), [IdP-sourced roles design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-10-idp-sourced-staff-roles-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#Role> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`Manager`, `Coordinator`, `Admin`, `AppointmentStaff`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Remaining bookable headcount for one `AppointmentType` on one `ConfirmedSlot`. While the slot is `Active`, its current Manager may replace `totalHeadcount` with a positive total that covers every active booking requiring that type; `remainingCapacity` changes by the same delta." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SlotCapacity" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotCapacity> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area B](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/b-slot-negotiation.md), [Area G](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/g-capacity-concurrency-rules.md), [Plan 03](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/03-domain-slot-negotiation.md), [Plan 20](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/20-confirmed-slot-capacity-adjustment.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotCapacity> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`confirmedSlotId`, `appointmentTypeId`, `totalHeadcount`, `remainingCapacity`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposalStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposalStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "`Open` until every `AppointmentType` has a `ProposalAcceptance`; `Confirmed` once a `ConfirmedSlot` has been derived from it; `Withdrawn` if a scoped `Manager` or `Admin` pulls it before that." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposalStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SlotProposalStatus" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposalStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposalStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area B](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/b-slot-negotiation.md), [Plan 03](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/03-domain-slot-negotiation.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposalStatus> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`Open`, `Withdrawn`, `Confirmed`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A candidate-facing 4-hour window proposed by one manager; other managers accept it independently. `date` and `startTime` are carried as one `SlotWindow`." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SlotProposal" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposal> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area B](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/b-slot-negotiation.md), [Plan 03](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/03-domain-slot-negotiation.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotProposal> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`id`, `date`, `startTime`, `status`, `createdByManagerUserId`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotWindow> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotWindow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The 4-hour candidate-facing window shared by `SlotProposal` and `ConfirmedSlot`. Duration is fixed at 4 hours, so the end time is derived, never stored. Persisted into the owning row's own `date` and `startTime` columns rather than a table of its own." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotWindow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SlotWindow" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotWindow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#ValueObject> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotWindow> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Plan 02](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/02-domain-appointment-types.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SlotWindow> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`date`, `startTime`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffAccessProfile> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffAccessProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The application's mirror of one authenticated staff identity's access: `roles` is written only by JointBooking's own identity-provider-claims sync and is never administered directly, while `appointmentTypeId` and `version` remain fully Admin-owned. Admin is exclusive and unscoped; Coordinator may combine with Manager and/or AppointmentStaff; Manager and AppointmentStaff share one `AppointmentType` scope, which may briefly be null immediately after a scoped role is synced and before an Admin assigns it — that transitional shape grants no capabilities. Absence of a profile means the authenticated identity is unassigned." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffAccessProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StaffAccessProfile" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffAccessProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffAccessProfile> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Issue #71 implementation](detailed-implementations/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization/00-overview.md), [IdP-sourced roles design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-10-idp-sourced-staff-roles-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffAccessProfile> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`staffUserId`, `roles`, `appointmentTypeId` (nullable), `version`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffCapability> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffCapability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The named permissions `StaffAccessAuthorizer` checks a `StaffAccessProfile`'s `roles` against, pinning down the \"capability\" vocabulary the Issue #71 design describes only in prose (its role/capability table). Every staff-facing handler requests one of these rather than checking `Role` directly, so a newly added role gains only the capabilities its role mapping grants." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffCapability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StaffCapability" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffCapability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Enum> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffCapability> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Issue #71 design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization-design.md), [Plan 02](detailed-implementations/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization/02-authorization-and-persistence.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffCapability> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#values> "`ManageSettings`, `ManageStaffAccess`, `ImportConfirmedSlots`, `ManageCandidates`, `ViewCandidateDashboards`, `ViewCandidateAudit`, `ViewSlotAudit`, `ManageSlotNegotiation`, `ViewSlotOperations`, `CancelConfirmedSlot`, `ConductAppointments`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The application's mirror of one authenticated staff identity: the provider-assigned `staffUserId` paired with the `StaffId` that identity's token carries, learned from the token itself. It exists so an Admin can address a colleague by `StaffId` instead of by opaque identifier, and so `StaffId` can be shown wherever a staff identity is displayed. `displayName` is the same idea applied to a human-readable name rather than the staff number, mirrored from the token's own name claim when the identity provider is configured to emit one; it is null when no such claim has ever been observed for that identity. It is a cache of identity-provider-owned data and is never the source of truth for any field. A row appears the first time an identity calls the API, which may be before any `StaffAccessProfile` assigns it a role." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StaffIdentity" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffIdentity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#Entity> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffIdentity> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[StaffId claim design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-staff-id-claim-design.md), [Staff identity display name design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-15-staff-identity-display-name-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffIdentity> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`staffUserId`, `staffId`, `displayName` (nullable), `lastSeenAt`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The enterprise-wide staff number issued by the HR system and used as the internal primary key by older enterprise systems. Exactly 7 characters: `U` or `N` followed by 6 digits, case-insensitive — always normalised to uppercase, so two values differing only in case are the same `StaffId`. Unique per member of staff, never reissued and never changed, which is what makes it safe for JointBooking to mirror. The identity provider is its source of truth; JointBooking only ever reads it from a token claim and never edits it." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StaffId" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#ValueObject> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffId> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[StaffId claim design](superpowers/specs/2026-09-07-staff-id-claim-design.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#StaffId> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#fields> "`value`" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SyncStaffAccessProfileRoles> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SyncStaffAccessProfileRoles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reads the caller's identity-provider `roles` claim during `GET /api/me`, upserts `StaffAccessProfile.roles` only when it differs from the persisted value, clears dependent `appointmentTypeId` scope when no scoped role remains, and rejects (without overwriting) a syntactically valid but semantically invalid role combination. Not reachable through any Admin-facing route." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SyncStaffAccessProfileRoles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "SyncStaffAccessProfileRoles" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#SyncStaffAccessProfileRoles> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#UseCase> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
