<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#UserRoleAssignment> <https://jointbooking.internal/ontology-kit#definedIn> "[Area I](superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-joint-booking/i-roles-access-control.md), [Plan 12](detailed-implementations/2026-09-03-joint-booking/12-api-staff-endpoints.md), [Issue #71 implementation](detailed-implementations/2026-09-06-scoped-multi-role-authorization/00-overview.md)" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
