<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#VoidBooking> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#VoidBooking> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Increments `SlotCapacity` (via `AdjustSlotCapacity`), voids a `Booking`, and resets the `Candidate`'s status to \"Not yet invited\". Shared by both cancellation paths." <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
<https://jointbooking.internal/ontology#VoidBooking> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "VoidBooking" <urn:division-ontology:source:jamiemitchellconsultants%2FJointBooking:6957928a6c9054372dda915b359f63b73969ebee> .
